@Host = http://localhost:5081

### Register a real user (sets access_token cookie automatically)
POST {{Host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Owais Test",
  "email": "owais@university.edu",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### Verify current session from cookie
GET {{Host}}/api/auth/me

### Create a Project (calls sp_CreateProjectWithOwner)
POST {{Host}}/api/projects
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "projectName": "DBMS Final Project",
  "description": "Task management system with SQL Server triggers and views",
  "deadline": "2026-12-20T23:59:59Z"
}

### Create a Task with Tags (calls sp_CreateTaskWithTags)
POST {{Host}}/api/projects/1/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assigneeId": 1,
  "parentTaskId": null,
  "title": "Test Audit Log Trigger",
  "description": "Move status to Done and verify TaskAuditLogs",
  "priority": "High",
  "dueDate": "2026-12-01T17:00:00Z",
  "tagIds": [1, 2]
}

### Update Task Status (fires trg_Tasks_AuditUpdate)
PATCH {{Host}}/api/tasks/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Done"
}

### View Full Task Details + Audit Trail
GET {{Host}}/api/tasks/1

### View Analytics Dashboard Overview (queries SQL Views)
GET {{Host}}/api/dashboard/overview